From f056820fc1ee41c5e502e30178bae70cfef3d32c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shanks <shanks@book>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:06:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/37] fix(transportd): CX-0001 release evidence machinery

Release gates self-contained and input-validated: export/sbom/wire/
release-evidence gates + static-test now validate non-sh inputs,
materialize the exact release artifact + externally-stored receipt before
release-tag-verify, verify artifact-bound SBOM, and enforce release
identity ancestry (declared source_commit must be an actual ancestor).
Applies the consolidated format pass to touched code.

(cherry picked from commit 05289a36b7d2dc0db62fe1d8fa0bb94a4abc5f84)
